        "note": "3 ROWS -- countyID 6037 (Los Angeles, CA), 17031 (Cook, IL) and 26161 (Washtenaw, MI) -- AND THAT IS WHY THIS RUN IS HERE. Every other RunSpec in this tree selects one county, so the county was a SCALAR of the run: `run_countyID`, `run_zoneID`, `run_linkID` and `run_stateID` were all shaped over the one-row carrier relation, and the county/road-type join PLAN.md §7.3.3 added to narrow the national `Link` was only ever evaluated at width 1. `n_runspeccounty` is discovered from this extent, and it now sizes the output relation's second level.",
